## 🧠 Testing Strategy

### 🔍 Manual Testing
- Validate drag-and-drop behavior
- Check connection logic and prevention
- Simulate performance metrics
- Test save/load functionality

### ⚙️ Automated Testing *(future enhancement)*
- Use Jest or Vitest for unit tests
- Simulate user interactions with React Testing Library
- Validate state updates and metric calculations

